ROW ROW_11 GF018hv5v_mcu_sc7 13440 117600 FS DO 226 BY 1 STEP 1120 0 ;
TRACKS X 560 DO 250 STEP 1120 LAYER Metal1 ;
TRACKS Y 560 DO 143 STEP 1120 LAYER Metal1 ;
